---
title: Courgette, Asparagus & Mozarella Tart
source: Green Roasting Tin
servings: 4
prep time: 10 minutes
cook time: 30 minutes
---

Preheat the oven to 180°C.

Mix @courgettes{2}(sliced very thin) and @asparagus{200%g} in a bowl with @olive oil{0.5%tbsp}, @sea salt{0.5%tsp}, @lemon{1}(zest only), @ground black pepper{}, and @fresh dill{2%sprig}(roughly chopped).

Lay the @puff pastry{320%g}(ready-rolled) on a lined #roasting tray{} and spread with @crème fraîche{2%tbsp}, leaving a 2.5cm border around the edges.

Arrange the courgette slices like fish scales, slightly overlapping, on top of the crème fraîche, then lay over first the @mozarella{100%g}(thinly sliced), then the asparagus.

Transfer to the oven and cook for ~{30%minutes}.

Serve hot, with a salad or @cherry tomatoes{}(roasted or dressed) alongside.
